WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.945 --> 00:00:01.570
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:01.570 --> 00:00:05.200
SPEAKER: Thank you, veterans.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:11.200
Thank you for quiet mornings,
family breakfasts, morning

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.298
walks, and safe streets.

00:00:15.298 --> 00:00:22.570
For builders, both of
cities and of homes.

00:00:22.570 --> 00:00:27.890
Thank you for realists,
ordinary optimists, coffee shop

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:31.550
companies, and
boardroom companies.

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:38.330
For freedoms, choices, beliefs.

00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:39.770
Thank you for your oath.

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:49.022
Thank you for 2:00 AM night
watches, 5:00 AM ruck launches,

00:00:49.022 --> 00:00:52.770
for scrubbing,
mopping, plunging,

00:00:52.770 --> 00:00:56.190
for papers, plans, and routes.

00:00:56.190 --> 00:01:00.890
For six hour convoys and
six month deployments.

00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:09.070
Thank you for following
orders, leading your team,

00:01:09.070 --> 00:01:13.250
and carrying your
brothers back home.

00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:18.530
Thank you, veterans, for
sticking to your oath

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:23.390
so that we all can wake up to
another quiet morning tomorrow.

00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:26.740
[MUSIC PLAYING]

